<title>PHILIPPINES: Tarlac sets July 10 for stock div record.</title>
<headline>Tarlac sets July 10 for stock div record.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sugar miller Central Azucarera de Tarlac said on Wednesday the Securities and Exchange Commission had set July 10 as the record date for its 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The ex-dividend date is on July 1.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
